<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Spie Batignolles buyout.</title>
<headline>EU clears Spie Batignolles buyout.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had cleared the acquisition of French construction firm Spie Batignolles SA by its employees alongside Amec Plc.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Spie Batignolles, previously owned by Schneider SA, and Amec operated mainly in their domestic markets.</p>
<p>It noted that they were both active in civil engineering in Germany and in mechanical and electrical services in Britain, but it said the overlaps were not significant.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom 322 2876841</p>
</text>
